---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
description: Knights of Columbus Southern California Chapter, serving 21 districts across Greater Los Angeles.
homePage: true
permalink: /
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="shell hero-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow" style="color:#f3ddb0">Knights of Columbus</p>
      <h1>Faith and service across Southern California.</h1>
      <p class="lede">The Southern California Chapter brings together councils across the Greater Los Angeles area to strengthen Catholic fraternity, charitable service, and cooperation.</p>
      <div class="theme-line">Our hearts are restless until they rest in You</div>
      <div class="button-row"><a class="button gold" href="/councils/">Explore our councils</a><a class="button ghost" href="/events/">View events</a><a class="button ghost" href="/join/">Join the Knights</a></div>
    </div>
    <aside class="hero-seal"><strong>21</strong><span>districts supporting 81 subordinate councils across Greater Los Angeles.</span></aside>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="shell chapter-band">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">One chapter, many councils</p><h2>Stronger together in faith and action.</h2></div>
    <div><p>The Chapter supports cooperation among councils, advances the mission and objectives of the Knights of Columbus in the local area, and connects leaders with programs and resources.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Understand our place in the Order →</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section tint">
  <div class="shell"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Faith in action</p><h2>Our program areas</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/programs/">See every program →</a></div>
    <div class="card-grid">{% for program in programs %}<div class="card"><h3>{{ program.name }}</h3><p>{{ program.description }}</p><a href="/programs/{{ program.href }}">Explore {{ program.name | lower }} →</a></div>{% endfor %}</div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="shell chapter-band">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Chapter leadership</p><h2>Serving councils with purpose.</h2><p>Meet the officers, directors, and committee chairmen who support the work of the Chapter.</p><a class="button" href="/leadership/">Meet our leadership</a></div>
    <div class="stat-row"><div class="stat"><strong>21</strong><span>districts</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>81</strong><span>councils served</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>74</strong><span>currently listed</span></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section tint"><div class="shell chapter-band"><div><p class="eyebrow">Chapter calendar</p><h2>What is happening next</h2></div>{% if collections.upcomingEvents.length %}{% set nextEvent = collections.upcomingEvents[0] %}<div class="notice"><p class="eyebrow">{{ nextEvent.data.dateDisplay }}</p><h3>{{ nextEvent.data.title }}</h3><p><strong>{{ nextEvent.data.venue }}</strong><br>{{ nextEvent.data.city }}</p><a href="{{ nextEvent.url }}">View event details →</a></div>{% else %}<div class="notice"><h3>Events will be posted here soon.</h3><p>Chapter leaders are preparing the first schedule of gatherings, programs, and deadlines.</p><a href="/events/">Visit the events page →</a></div>{% endif %}</div></section>
